TIP:  The intro has four notes (notes may or may not transpose) in quick succession that are a little tricky.  Untransposed, here's how I play it (assuming you play (G) with the middle finger on the top string):  Form (G).  Pick the open 3rd string <g>, now flatten the index finger to cover and pick the 4th string/2nd fret and pick <e>, lift off and pick the open 4th string <d>, and pick the open 3rd string <g> again and strum (G).  Of course you can forget about picking the notes at all and just go with the chords.


